sho-metrics-source-linux (0.3.0+linux1-0ppa1~ubuntu24.04.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First PPA build of the Sho Metrics Linux helper daemon, from fork tag
    v0.3.0-linux.1.
  * Node dependencies are vendored in the source tarball; the package needs
    nodejs 20 or newer at runtime, which on 24.04 means NodeSource or another
    backport.

